I have just published "Ascent", my first proper game which I developed for the 2024 Computer Graphics course at TU Vienna. It's available on
[GitHub](https://github.com/Qendolin/ptvc24-ascent). In the "Releases" section you can find a download for Windows and Linux. But be aware that the Linux build
has not been tested and requires a recent version of glibc.

